               MOVE EIBCALEN TO WS-CALEN.
               SET WS-ADDR-COMMAREA TO ADDRESS OF DFHCOMMAREA.
               PERFORM COMPUTE-WITH-PROFITS-0001.
               PERFORM COMPUTE-SUM-ASSURED-0002.
               PERFORM COMPUTE-HOUSE-TYPE-0003.
               PERFORM RESOLVE-EXCESS-0005.
